{
  "version": 1,
  "about": [
    "ARMED tier of the loud-failure watcher (loud-check.ps1): lines a healthy boot must print, one per feature.",
    "Seeded 2026-10-11 from the 138 'loaded / registered / armed' lines every healthy boot since the audit prints.",
    "Rules: (1) an entry names its owner, so a commit that deletes or renames a feature removes or updates its entry;",
    "(2) `pattern` is a .NET regex searched in each line of `log`; script lines carry their own script path, which is part of the pattern;",
    "(3) `must_not` lists lines that mean the feature failed even though its armed line printed;",
    "(4) `min` is a floor for the first capture group of `pattern`;",
    "(5) a line printed at file load proves LOADED, not ARMED: loot and recipe scripts print theirs inside the handler.",
    "The LOADED tier (one 'Loaded script' line per deployed script, both summary lines) is generated from expected_state.json and is not listed here."
  ],
  "boot_complete": {"log": "latest.log", "pattern": "Done \\(\\d+\\.\\d+s\\)!", "note": "liveness is judged only once this line exists; before it the server is still starting (or died on the way)"},
  "entries": [
    {"id": "armed:0_iss_guard.js", "owner": "kubejs/server_scripts/0_iss_guard.js", "log": "kubejs/server.log", "pattern": "0_iss_guard\\.js#\\d+: \\[iss-guard\\] loaded"},
    {"id": "armed:0_lib_aptitudes.js", "owner": "kubejs/server_scripts/0_lib_aptitudes.js", "log": "kubejs/server.log", "pattern": "0_lib_aptitudes\\.js#\\d+: \\[IridescentCraft\\] 0_lib_aptitudes loaded -- global\\.icraft\\.aptitude .* direct AptitudeCapability read"},
    {"id": "armed:0_lib_core.js", "owner": "kubejs/server_scripts/0_lib_core.js", "log": "kubejs/server.log", "pattern": "0_lib_core\\.js#\\d+: \\[IridescentCraft\\] 0_lib_core loaded -- global\\.icraft\\.core"},
    {"id": "armed:0_lib_origins.js", "owner": "kubejs/server_scripts/0_lib_origins.js", "log": "kubejs/server.log", "pattern": "0_lib_origins\\.js#\\d+: \\[IridescentCraft\\] 0_lib_origins loaded -- global\\.icraft\\.origin"},
    {"id": "armed:0_lib_registry.js", "owner": "kubejs/server_scripts/0_lib_registry.js", "log": "kubejs/server.log", "pattern": "0_lib_registry\\.js#\\d+: \\[icraft\\.registry\\] loaded -- bosses: \\d+ entries .* dimensions: \\d+ entries", "must_not": ["\\[icraft\\.registry\\] NOT LOADED"], "note": "the boss and dimension registries (kubejs/config/icraft/registry/*.json) were read and accepted; every roster script asks them"},
    {"id": "armed:0_server_ready_banner.js", "owner": "kubejs/server_scripts/0_server_ready_banner.js", "log": "kubejs/server.log", "pattern": "0_server_ready_banner\\.js#\\d+:\\s+>>>\\s+IridescentCraft Server READY"},
    {"id": "armed:0_tick_master.js:player", "owner": "kubejs/server_scripts/0_tick_master.js", "log": "kubejs/server.log", "pattern": "0_tick_master\\.js#\\d+: \\[TickMaster\\] Registered (\\d+) player tick functions", "min": 19, "note": "floor = the count on 2026-10-11"},
    {"id": "armed:0_tick_master.js:server", "owner": "kubejs/server_scripts/0_tick_master.js", "log": "kubejs/server.log", "pattern": "0_tick_master\\.js#\\d+: \\[TickMaster\\] Registered (\\d+) server tick functions", "min": 43, "note": "floor = the count on 2026-10-11; a tick function that stops registering drops the count"},
